WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Flute music] The sound tour moves the cursor over NASA's Air Humidity map by itself.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[Flute music] Higher notes mean more water vapour in the air; lower notes mean drier air.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[Flute music] The label next to the cursor shows the place and the humidity in g/kg.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[Flute music continues as the cursor moves around South America and out over the South Atlantic]
